# Private job-search data lives in the private career-ops repo
# (command-center/) and is symlinked here so the vault still renders it.
# Never commit these paths; see tools/private_paths.py.
16-Interview-Command-Center/02-Companies
16-Interview-Command-Center/03-Pipeline
16-Interview-Command-Center/04-Retrospectives
16-Interview-Command-Center/05-Behavioral
